title: "Prime-race crossings with a deadline and a transcendental height ratio"
abstract: "Strict opposite 547/727 moves finish before 251H for every H through exp(12500). Opposite exact crossings with transcendental height ratio finish before 3208H, or before 27534H in either prescribed order. All three bounds are unconditional."
